# Unified inbox: conversations of every agent mailbox, replying in the thread.
# Threads are addressed with the `thread_id` query parameter (provider ids can contain `/`).
# Reading needs `workflows:read`; changing and replying needs `ai:review`.

@token = PASTE-A-REVIEWER-PRICING-OR-ADMIN-DEV-TOKEN
@threadId = PASTE-A-THREAD-ID

### Folders: inbox, unread, awaiting, drafts, snoozed, done, sent, all
GET {{baseUrl}}/inbox/conversations?folder=inbox&limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtered: one agent's mailbox, a reply type, a label, assigned to me, search
GET {{baseUrl}}/inbox/conversations?folder=all&bucket=rate_query&mine=true&search=gulf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Numbers next to the folders
GET {{baseUrl}}/inbox/counts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A conversation with its messages (oldest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/inbox/conversation?thread_id={{threadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark read, label and assign
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/inbox/conversation?thread_id={{threadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "read": true,
  "labels": ["Reefer", "Urgent"],
  "assignee_email": "pricing@forwarder.example"
}

### Snooze until tomorrow morning (it comes back to the inbox then)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/inbox/conversation?thread_id={{threadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "snoozed_until": "2026-10-01T09:00:00+04:00"
}

### Done (back in the inbox when the contact writes again)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/inbox/conversation?thread_id={{threadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "done": true
}

### Reply in the thread: sent by the thread's agent with the signature, through every guardrail
POST {{baseUrl}}/inbox/conversation/reply?thread_id={{threadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: inbox-reply-001

{
  "body": "Hello Ahmed,\n\nThe Chennai → Rotterdam rates follow tomorrow by noon."
}
